msgstr "Explora Resúmenes Personales"

#: app/templates/about.html:335
msgid "From news to deliberation"
msgstr "De noticias a deliberación"

#: app/templates/about.html:336
msgid ""
"Curated civic news and spectrum transparency feed the Engage step — then "
"seed statements and discussions carry issues into structured participation."
msgstr ""
"Las noticias cívicas curadas y la transparencia del espectro alimentan el "
"paso Participar — luego afirmaciones iniciales y discusiones llevan "
