#: app/templates/about.html:337
msgid "How we source news for debate"
msgstr "Cómo seleccionamos noticias para debate"

#: app/templates/about.html:343
msgid "Built in the open"
msgstr "Construido en abierto"

#: app/templates/about.html:344
msgid ""
"Society Speaks is open source (AGPL). Audit the code, contribute "
"improvements, or self-host components for your own civic stack."
msgstr ""
"Society Speaks es código abierto (AGPL). Audita el código, contribuye "
"mejoras, o aloja componentes por tu cuenta para tu propia infraestructura "
"cívica."

#: app/templates/about.html:345
msgid ""
"The code and the data are licensed separately: individual votes and "
"responses are never sold and never licensed to anyone. Only aggregate, "
"anonymised patterns — what society agrees on, where it divides, how "
"judgement shifts over time — may be licensed to institutions, and that "
"revenue keeps the platform free and ad-free."
msgstr ""
"El código y los datos tienen licencias distintas: los votos y respuestas "
"individuales nunca se venden ni se licencian a nadie. Solo los patrones "
"agregados y anonimizados —en qué coincide la sociedad, dónde se divide, cómo"
" cambia el criterio con el tiempo— pueden licenciarse a instituciones, y "
"esos ingresos mantienen la plataforma gratuita y sin publicidad."

#: app/templates/about.html:347
msgid "View Society Speaks source code on GitHub (opens in new tab)"
msgstr ""
"Ver el código fuente de Society Speaks en GitHub (se abre en nueva pestaña)"

#: app/templates/about.html:350 app/templates/brief/subscribe.html:304
