msgid "Consensus Analysis"
msgstr "Análisis de consenso"

#: app/templates/platform.html:36
msgid "Nuanced debate.<br>Rigorous analysis."
msgstr "Debate matizado.<br>Análisis riguroso."

#: app/templates/platform.html:39
msgid ""
"Vote on statements. Discover where you agree with people you thought you "
"didn't. See what the data actually reveals — not percentages, but clusters "
"of real opinion."
msgstr ""
"Vota sobre afirmaciones. Descubre dónde estás de acuerdo con personas que "
"pensabas que no. Ve lo que los datos realmente revelan — no porcentajes, "
"sino clusters de opinión real."

