msgstr "Redactamos tus afirmaciones"

#: app/templates/consultations/question.html:76
msgid ""
"In about a minute you will have a balanced set of statements to review. You "
"can edit, remove or add to them before anyone sees them."
msgstr ""
"En aproximadamente un minuto tendrás un conjunto equilibrado de afirmaciones"
" para revisar. Puedes editarlas, eliminarlas o añadir otras antes de que "
"nadie las vea."

#: app/templates/consultations/question.html:77
msgid "Nothing is shared and nothing is charged at this stage."
msgstr "En esta fase no se comparte nada ni se cobra nada."

